# a kit's Insert 1: FX's first page on T1 shapes the whole kit (after its bus filter): PRESET picks the effect, the
# knobs its amount, tone and mix; a step held + FX: the lock pages reach it (SELECT from Sends to Insert 1)
wait 300
expect trk 1
expect par1.ctype 0
tap FX
expect page Insert_1
turn PRESET 1
expect par1.ctype 1
spin K1 10
expect par1.camt 74
spin K4 -27
expect par1.cmix 100
tapkey b1
wait 60
shot kit_character.png
tap PLAY
wait 400
tap PLAY
